{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>And you shall not covet your fellow's house.</b> And in the first Decalogue it is written (Exodus 20:14) ״לא תחמד בית רעך״ — you shall not covet your fellow's house — meaning, you shall not covet with money, and you shall not desire without money; that is, one should not desire and contemplate this in his heart, for this thought will bring him to acquire it with money, and he will be found transgressing ״לא תחמד״."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:45:49.477118388Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}